: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">따라 본교는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">2016</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년 단기 및 중기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">WEST </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">참가 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">※</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">중복지원 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학생의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학년</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-